WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.024
What if cricket never came to India?

00:00:02.094 --> 00:00:03.624
Cricket arrived with the British.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:06.410
Today, it's the biggest
sport in the country, by far.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.110
Without it, another sport
might have taken its place.

00:00:09.236 --> 00:00:13.226
Hockey, which India dominated for decades,
or football or kabaddi.

00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:14.846
The IPL wouldn't exist.

00:00:14.997 --> 00:00:19.807
Advertising money, sponsorships and TV
deals would flow to other sports instead.

00:00:19.967 --> 00:00:23.037
And millions of children would have
grown up idolising someone else,

00:00:23.207 --> 00:00:25.977
instead of Tendulkar, Dhoni or Kohli.

00:00:25.977 --> 00:00:27.947
Cricket is more than a sport in India.

00:00:28.013 --> 00:00:30.103
So what if cricket never came to India?

